Conventions asset list page template
title end

paragraph start
An asset list names every file of one kind that the brand needs, one per line, with where it is used and its status. It is a plain inventory and does not describe the assets.
paragraph end

paragraph start
It is a note page with one code block, because the lines are kept exactly as written.
paragraph end

